{
  "description": "Submit a turn proposal to the Indy_Reads governor. The governor validates, sanitizes authority-bearing fields, and decides. Output is a proposal, never an action.",
  "name": "submit_proposal",
  "parameters": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "description": "The fields an LLM tool call may set on a proposal. Authority-bearing\nfields (`authority`, `verified`, `execute`, `claim_status`) are\ndeliberately absent — the governor strips and records them; they are\nnot part of any tool contract.",
